            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DKR20U3, Brass Door Knob Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor new installations or restoration replacement solid brass door knobs with spindle. This replacement door knob set is used with tubular latches or old mortise locks found in older buildings and homes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DKR20_size.gif?v=1704442272\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DKR20U3 Brass Door Knobs Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana DKR20U3 Brass Door Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Four (4) Steel, Allen-head Set Screws</li>\r\n<li>Two (2) Brass Knobs</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Diameter: 1/4\" threaded ends</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Three Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DKR20.pdf?v=1704262260\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DKR20 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n*Sold as a set: 2 Door Knobs with set screws and 1 spindle\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
